  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Fashionably Ethic</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">J LABEL is a fashion brand for the conscious woman. All clothing is made from sustainable materials and production takes place in responsible, certified factories. J LABEL teaches her customers about the necessity of change in the clothing industry and uses documentaries as marketing tool. J LABEL produces &#x2018;Made to order&#x2019;. The pre-financing loan will enable the financing of two collections. And will support jobs in the factories sourced from.</narrative>
  </description>
